#[1] Local-only launchers at the repository root. Machine-specific .bat shortcuts that
#    carry absolute local paths, so they do not belong in a shared repository.
#    The leading / confines this to the root on purpose: launchers under 03_launchers\,
#    02_scripts\ and similar are project deliverables and must stay tracked.
#    Square brackets are a glob character class, so they MUST be escaped, or the rule
#    matches a filename that has never existed and silently protects nothing. Written as
#    a glob covering both the _ and the space separator seen in the fleet.
/\[*\]*.bat

#[2] OS clutter.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
